.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt DFTOOLBOX 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dftoolbox ,
.Nm dfmodtool
.Nd inspect and modify the data files of the game Dreamfall
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm dftoolbox
.Op Ar OPTION ...
.Nm dfmodtool
.Op Ar OPTION ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm dftoolbox
browses the .pak files of Dreamfall and shows the textures, dialog,
scripts, sounds, models and locations in them.
.Nm dfmodtool
installs mods into the game.
The
.Sy dftool-*
command line tools do the extraction and conversion, see the README.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl \-help
Show the usage and exit.
.It Fl v , Fl \-version
Show the version and exit.
.It Fl \-data\-dir Ar DIR
Location of the data files of the program.
.It Fl \-config\-dir Ar DIR
Location of the configuration files.
.It Fl \-cache\-dir Ar DIR
Location of the cached pak file tables.
.It Fl \-user\-data\-dir Ar DIR
Location of mods installed by the user.
.It Fl \-portable
Keep the configuration, user data and cache in
.Pa userdata/
next to the executable.
This is also enabled by a file
.Pa portable.txt
next to the executable.
.It Fl \-no\-save
Don't write any configuration in this run.
.It Fl \-show\-paths
Show the directories in use, where each came from, and exit.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/dftoolbox/
Configuration: the path of the game and the bookmarks.
.It Pa $XDG_CACHE_HOME/dftoolbox/
Cached pak file tables, can be deleted at any time.
.It Pa $XDG_DATA_HOME/dftoolbox/dreamfall-mods/
Mods for
.Sy dftool-insert .
.El
